--- !u!114 &717930227
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 717930225}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4ad59ff2e9a8d4470b20b295a6e486fe, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LevelNarrativeManager
  levelStartMessage: They're back, and something is leading them. I can feel it in
    the ink. Whatever it is wants this scroll gone. Not on our watch.
  levelStartFollowUpMessage: I've channeled extra magic into the defenders. Tap a
    placed tower to upgrade it.
  waveStartMessages:
  - waveIndex: 1
    message: Here they come again, and angrier. I can sense the King getting closer.
      Hold together!
  waveEndMessages:
  - waveIndex: 0
    message: "Good work. But look how they moved \u2014 that wasn't random. Something
      out there is giving orders. Stay sharp."
  - waveIndex: 1
    message: They're hitting harder. The King must be near, I can feel the ink surging.
  - waveIndex: 2
    message: We're holding, but barely. The Ink Blot King is coming himself. Upgrade
      what you can. This is the one that matters
  - waveIndex: 3
    message: He's gone. The ink is pulling back... it's really over. The scroll is
      safe. The coder is stirring. He'll never know how close we came. But we do.
      Well done.
  loseNarrativeMessage: No... The ink reached the scroll. Everything the coder worked
    for, corrupted. You tried. We all did. But it wasn't enough.
  endSceneName: 
